<title>USA: Stanley Works to issue earnings today.</title>
<headline>Stanley Works to issue earnings today.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Stanley Works shares was halted ahead of the company's quarterly earnings announcement, expected at about 1415 EDT, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman declined to say whether there would be any mention about a company restructuring.</p>
<p>The Wall Street Journal reported Thursday that Stanley Works would cut as many as 4,700 jobs, or about 25 percent of its workforce, in a restructuring expected to result in a charge against earnings.</p>
